---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Analysis & Results | NutriBean+">
  <div class="page-container">
    <section class="conclusions-header">
      <h1>CONCLUSIONS</h1>
      <p class="conclusions-lead">With the conclusion of the project and its analysis, we have highlighted the following results:[cite: 3]</p>

      <ul class="conclusions-list">
        <li>&bull; Enhancement of vegetable protein sources, in particular from soy and chickpeas, as an alternative to those of animal origin.[cite: 3]</li>
        <li>&bull; Low Water &amp; Carbon Footprint.[cite: 3]</li>
        <li>&bull; Negligible chemical treatments compared to other crops.[cite: 3]</li>
        <li>&bull; The contents of the soybean varieties of W.A.C., O.A.C., total polyphenols, antioxidant activity, proteins and lipids are higher than those of the chickpeas.[cite: 3]</li>
        <li>&bull; The waste has a good protein content (27.66%), the highest content of W.A.C., O.A.C., total polyphenols, antioxidant activity and negligible concentration of lipids (0.32%).[cite: 3]</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="conclusions-summary">
        To sum up, we discovered the high potential hidden inside these pods, demonstrating how even wastes can be useful, thus encouraging an environmentally-friendly economy.[cite: 3]
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="video-showcase">
      <p class="video-prompt">Have a look at our video!! &#8628;[cite: 3]</p>
      <div class="video-box">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581093588401-fbb62a02f120?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Anteprima video NutriBean+" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <button class="video-play-btn" aria-label="Play video">&#9654;</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="contest-banner">
    <img src="/logo.jpg" alt="NutriBean+ Logo" class="leaf-icon" />

    <div class="contest-badge">
      <span class="contest-year">2023[cite: 3]</span>
      <span class="contest-name">I GIOVANI E LE SCIENZE[cite: 3]</span>
    </div>

    <img src="/logo.jpg" alt="NutriBean+ Logo" class="leaf-icon right" />
  </section>

  <section class="experience-section">
    <h2>WHAT KIND OF<br />EXPERIENCE WE MADE[cite: 3]</h2>
    <p>
      We participated at the Italian national contest "I giovani e le scienze" organised by the FAST association, for the selection of the 34&deg; European Contest for Young Scientist (EUCYS) this year in Brussels.[cite: 3]
    </p>
    <p>
      The selection took part in Milan during the period from the 18th to the 20th of march 2023.<br />
      It was such a beautiful experience![cite: 3]
    </p>
    <p>
      We knew a lot of new people from all over the world, and everyone there had a lot of talent and passion in the scientific field, as well.[cite: 3]
    </p>
    <p>
      At the end of this fantastic event we received a big surprise: WE WON! together with two other groups the first prize: the possibility to represent Italy at the 34th edition of EUCYS.<br />
      With our experiment we won also the first prize for "the better project in the chemistry field" by "Societ&agrave; Chimica Italiana" and the prize for "scientific excellence and using science innovatively to create a potential solution to international development challenges" by the United State of Agency for International Development (USAID).[cite: 3]
    </p>
    <p class="experience-closing">
      Now we are looking forward to go to Brussels and have a lot of fun.[cite: 3]
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="experience-photo-full">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523580494863-6f3031224c94?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80" alt="Il team NutriBean+ allo stand di I Giovani e le Scienze" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  </div>
</Layout>
